% covers: 4 - Host: 127.0.0.1:9999 with the right token is 403 Forbidden: the port must be the server's own, and a following valid disp(x) finds x unassigned
POST /api HTTP/1.1
Host: 127.0.0.1:9999
X-SplatCrab-Token: test-token
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 39

{"id":1,"op":"eval","code":"x = 1 + 2"}
POST /api HTTP/1.1
Host: 127.0.0.1:8123
X-SplatCrab-Token: test-token
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 37

{"id":2,"op":"eval","code":"disp(x)"}
